== src/main.cheby:9:41 completion key key_without_default
{
  "count": 5,
  "isIncomplete": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "detail": "pub fn key<T>(default: T) -> context::Key<T>",
      "documentation": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Returns a key whose `get` gives `default` when no value is provided.\nIt must be the whole initializer of a `const`, and every other mention\nof it in an expression is E0080 (D-1045, D-1565, D-1581). The attribute\n`@std_initializer(key_at)` says so to the compiler, which replaces that\none call with a call of `key_at` that also passes the constant's path\nand the text of its value type (D-1572, D-1599). `key` never counts\ntoward satisfying an interface (D-1593). So no program reaches this\nbody, and it panics if a fault of the compiler ever lets one reach it\n(D-1598)."
      },
      "insertTextFormat": 2,
      "kind": 3,
      "label": "key",
      "labelDetails": {
        "description": "context",
        "detail": "(default)"
      },
      "sortText": "20key",
      "textEdit": {
        "newText": "key(${1:default})$0",
        "range": {
          "end": {
            "character": 40,
            "line": 8
          },
          "start": {
            "character": 38,
            "line": 8
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "detail": "pub fn key_without_default<T>() -> context::Key<Option<T>>",
      "documentation": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Returns a key whose default is `None`, for a dependency that has no\nsensible default. It must be the whole initializer of a `const`, as\n`key` must (D-1045, D-1565). Through `@std_initializer`, the compiler\nreplaces that one call with a call of `key_without_default_at` (D-1599).\nSo no program reaches this body, which panics as `key`'s does (D-1598)."
      },
      "kind": 3,
      "label": "key_without_default",
      "labelDetails": {
        "description": "context",
        "detail": "()"
      },
      "sortText": "20key_without_default",
      "textEdit": {
        "newText": "key_without_default()",
        "range": {
